WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.635
Archive immediately removes a service from the website while keeping its

00:00:05.685 --> 00:00:07.075
record in the admin.

00:00:07.125 --> 00:00:09.739
The confirmation explains the effect.

00:00:09.789 --> 00:00:12.548
Archived records can be restored later.

00:00:12.598 --> 00:00:16.292
We will cancel here and keep this service available.
